#: e5e6a8b946ae4592bfdd352e11f7cd10
msgid "按索引选择（Select by Index）"
msgstr "Select by index"

#: ../../source/module/nep-main-tool-select-index.md:3
#: 1ba129baff6b4e259b9e895b450025c0
msgid "作用与适用场景"
msgstr "Purpose and use cases"

#: ../../source/module/nep-main-tool-select-index.md:5
#: 69ddf0e741634611b622f702a15128ed
msgid ""
"根据结构编号或切片表达式批量选择结构。适合复现实验记录中的结构编号、从外部异常清单回选结构， "
"或精确选择不连续的多个区间。这个工具只更新选择集，不会删除或修改结构。"
msgstr ""
"Select structures in batches using indices or slice expressions. Use it "
"to reproduce recorded structure indices, select entries from an external "
"anomaly list, or target several disjoint ranges precisely. The tool only "
"updates the selection; it does not delete or modify structures."

#: ../../source/module/nep-main-tool-select-index.md:8
#: c0b4785c6f72472aac58bbc8a04cd65f
msgid "参数与示例"
msgstr "Parameters and Examples"

