msgstr "Index field: enter an index expression"

#: ../../source/module/nep-dataset-display-content.md:4704
#: e8e1789f08284521b8db5bd6c0881ca9
msgid "`使用原始索引`：默认勾选，按导入时的原始编号解释索引"
msgstr "`Use original indices`: checked by default; indices refer to the original order at import"

#: ../../source/module/nep-dataset-display-content.md:4705
#: fa45d6e3bfcd47d1a484cc99a8b55930
msgid "索引表达式支持："
msgstr "Supported index syntax:"

#: ../../source/module/nep-dataset-display-content.md:4706
#: 7e5c09a5f1ba46d595b914c6a3cc93e7
msgid "单值：`3`, `-1`"
msgstr "Single values: `3`, `-1`"

#: ../../source/module/nep-dataset-display-content.md:4707
#: 457cc7ab38644b7bb52862a6e44ee4ca
msgid "切片：`1:10`, `:100`, `::3`, `10:0:-1`"
msgstr "Slices: `1:10`, `:100`, `::3`, `10:0:-1`"

#: ../../source/module/nep-dataset-display-content.md:4708
#: 1f60ee40270b4517b851df4f1d9dfd05
msgid "多段：`1:10,20,30:40:2`（逗号或空白分隔）"
msgstr "Multiple segments: `1:10,20,30:40:2` (separated by commas or whitespace)"

#: ../../source/module/nep-dataset-display-content.md:4709
#: a39fad9d0a3c48ad93c2f661c86b7748
msgid "执行结果：解析后选中结构；空表达式无效果。"
msgstr ""
"Result: parse the expression and select the matching structures; an empty"
" expression has no effect."

