#: ../../source/module/nep-main-tool-select-index.md:17
#: 46651acb2a014eadaac7e72e4b0be328
msgid ""
"查看底部 `Sel` 数量是否与表达式预期一致。勾选“使用原始索引”时，编号对应刚导入数据时的索引； "
"关闭后则对应当前活动数据的行号，删除结构后两者可能不同。"
msgstr ""
"Check that the bottom `Sel` count matches the expression. With `Use "
"original indices` enabled, indices refer to the newly imported dataset; "
"when disabled, they refer to row numbers in the current active data. The "
"two can differ after structures are removed."

